-by-default diagnostic switch.\n\n## Plan\n- Point cross-ticket overlap guidance to ADR 0086.\n- Point transport retry guidance to ADR 0087.\n- Describe `REBAR_OPERATION_SNAPSHOT_SHADOW` as an active diagnostic switch and state its current default and false-value behavior.\n- Preserve the distinction between diagnostic snapshot composition and behavior-bearing configuration.\n- Change Markdown only and do not alter the switch.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [x] Cross-ticket overlap and transport retry links resolve to ADR 0086 and ADR 0087.\n- [x] The shadow switch is documented as active, diagnostic, and enabled by default.\n- [x] False spellings and invalid-value behavior match `shadow_enabled()`.\n- [x] No source, test, or configuration behavior changes.\n- [x] Targeted documentation index and link checks pass.","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[{"path":"docs/config.md","reason":"Correct ADR references and diagnostic-switch guidance."}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[["parent","fa8f-e53f-d6b9-475e"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":"fa8f-e53f-d6b9-475e","parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":[],"ticket_id":"5441-83be-9c11-4338","ticket_type":"task","title":"F19C correct configuration decision and diagnostic guidance","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["8dbca5f1-9679-4fdc-a00d-167c63c62bda","faa61811-96cf-4f75-b731-88d8fa61f65b"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1788236903853031001,"uuid":"811d6c44-0bf3-43e0-8839-e7631e6f30d6"}